<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NIIT started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NIIT started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities analyst Ajay Malpani has started coverage of Indian computer training company NIIT Ltd with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In an April 25 report, Malpani wrote that NIIT was undervalued and an attractive investment.</p>
<p>-- He estimated net cash generation of 3.1 billion rupees after dividends and working capital needs from fiscal year 1996 through 2000.</p>
<p>--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879</p>
